<GuideLayout 
  title="Fabric Longevity Testing: Ensuring Your Activewear Lasts 100+ Washes" 
  type="QUALITY CONTROL"
  description="A look inside our lab's durability testing. How Fitclo protects your brand's reputation for long-lasting quality."
>
  <h2>Quality That Outlasts the Competition</h2>
  <p>For premium brands, the "Second Purchase" depends on how the first garment feels after 6 months. As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we focus on fabric longevity to protect your customer lifetime value (CLV).</p>

  <h3>Pilling & Abrasion Resistance</h3>
  <p>We subject all Nylon/Spandex samples to Martindale abrasion tests (simulating thousands of rubs). We only approve fabrics that exceed Level 4 pilling resistance, ensuring your leggings stay smooth for years. This is a critical quality signal for mature markets like the UK and USA.</p>

  <h3>Colorfastness & Inventory Management</h3>
  <p>We test for color bleeding in sweat and salt-water. By maintaining a high-quality <strong>Inventory Management</strong> of premium dyes, we guarantee that your vibrant blacks and brights remain true, shipment after shipment. Our <strong>Global Logistics</strong> ensures these high-quality goods reach you in perfect condition.</p>
</GuideLayout>
